Minecraft Cursor Theme

======================

Extract the folder to ~/.icons/

(for all users, extract the folder to /usr/share/icons/)

If the theme doesn't show up in your selections, you might need to edit 
the "Inherits" line in the index.theme file in: 

/usr/share/icons/default/

to:

Inherits=minecraft

Enjoy!

